# BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile (context = repo root)
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
frontend/dist
data
deploy/.env
**/*.db

# macOS Finder duplicates created when unpacking a tarball over an existing folder ("file 2.ts")
**/* [0-9].*
**/* [0-9][0-9].*
**/.DS_Store
